    f"Independent evaluation rebuilt eight canonical supports, checked {ev['rank_values_checked']} AP/AUROC values, every screen and matched contrast, and reconstructed {ev['blended_score_pixels']} score pixels from {ev['raw_tiles']} raw tiles. Maximum ranking discrepancy {ev['maximum_rank_difference']:.3g}; maximum independent sigmoid/Hann blend discrepancy {ev['maximum_blend_difference']:.3g}, below the predeclared 2e-6 tolerance. Ranking checks use the retained FP32 scores, so reconstructed floating-point differences are not silently used to alter ties.", '',
